    [CI]  renaming the volume from driver-version to ascend-driver  (#18515)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    This pull request updates the Ascend driver volume mount path in the
    multi-node LWS template to include the entire driver directory instead
    of just the tools subdirectory. The review feedback recommends renaming
    the volume from driver-version to ascend-driver to avoid confusion, as
    the mount contains the full driver directory. Additionally, the reviewer
    advises updating the PR title and summary to align with the repository's
    style guide.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    no
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/8cc9aa5ad350f6f80cf3bebb298d410803ff75a9
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: guxin108 <1252896542@qq.com>

